Language English
Debug Off

// All text in FirstRitual defaults to goal = closeGate

Book MythosController Ordered No Keep
	
	Page TakeAction 
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @Mythos
		No Text
		
		Trigger @Sarah
		Trigger @Wanderers
		Trigger @HealingStone
		Trigger @StartFirstRitual
		Trigger @EndGameRitual
		
		Exit
	End Page TakeAction

	// this will start and manage the ritual
	// the ritual runs to the end of the game for goalOpenGate
	// for goalFeedGate and goalCloseGate, it runs until the
	// investigators are pulled into the altar room
	Page StartFirstRitual 
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @Ritual If firstRitual = firstRitualNotStarted And firstRitual <> firstRitualOver
		No Text
		
		found = foundJournal + foundDvm + foundElderSign + foundRitualDagger
		explored = exploredCryptViaChapel + exploredDungeonCaveViaBasement + exploredDungeonCell
		read = dvmFinished + journalFinished
		
		// if we're not jerks, we get an extra tick to get everything ready
		readyCount = 9 - (5 - #heros) * 2 + exploredGateNicely
		

		/*
		#heros	nice	#things left to do before we start
		3		0		2	
		3		1		1	
		4		0		3
		4		1		2
		5		0		4
		5		1		3
		*/
		
		There are 9 things total
		if found + explored + read >= 9 - #heros + exploredGateNicely Then firstRitual = firstRitualStarted
		startOnCount = #heros + exploredGateNicely

		Exit
	End Page StartOrContinueFirstRitual


	
	/*
	Ritual Steps in Mythos:
	
	Boy

	
		Rules:  every goal
	
	Gate
		You feel the power of the spell Matthias is casting. It draws you in and repulses you at the same time. A woman screams. The sound pierces the walls of the house, making the windows rattle in their frames. You feel her take a deep, gasping breath, then she screams again. And again. And again. The screaming sends a chill through you. Each investigator takes 2 Horror ({will} negates).
		
		if goalOpenGate: Sarah whispers, <<Our cousin has started the opening ritual. We must stop him.>>
		
		Rules:  every goal
		
		For goalOpenGate, this is the end; they have 2 - 3 rounds before a hard fail
		
	
	Woman

		
		If goalFeedGate, Sarah whispers, <<The gate is open, but you have the 
		elder sign. Matthias cannot stabilize the gate; instead, he will need a ready supply of blood sacrifice. Maybe
		we can cut off the supply.
		
		if goalCloseGate: Sarah whispers, <<The gate is open. You must perform the closing ritual.>>
		
		For goalFeedGate, this is the end. In 2 - 3 rounds, hard fail
		
		Rules:  goalFeedGate Or goalCloseGate
		
	Seal/Stabilize
			The woman screams again. After a few seconds, it doesn't sound human. Then the screaming stops and something... changes.
			The gates power in the house has been uneven, sputtering and popping, but now it is seems to be stabilizing. Sarah whispers,
			<<I think Matthias has used an elder sign to stabilize and hold open the gate. This is bad. We must get to the altar to stop him.>>
	
		Rules:  goalCloseGate

	Summons--at altar
		Matthias is still at the altar and still speaking a language you do not understand. The gate glows and hums, but it seems to be stable now. Matthias is focused on the gate. You can see by his excitement that he is anticipating something. You can feel it growing closer... a cold dread creeping into your already-pounding heart. You don't have long now. 

		Sarah confirms your fear when she leans in and says, <<He is summoning his god. You must stop him. You must kill him.>>

		Rules:  goalCloseGate And foundAltar

	Summons--not at altar
		You feel the house inhale again; your candle flickers and dances. A low drone signals that something important just happened. Even from here, away from the altar, you can feel a  pulsing of evil, a force from underground.

		Sarah whispers desperately, <<He has started the summoning. I can feel the call to his god. We don't have much time.>>

		Rules:  goalFeedGate Or goalCloseGate

	Summoning continues
		{c:CustomMonsterDavidSmythe} continues summoning... something.


	
	
	Continues
	Fail
	
	*/
	

End Book MythosController
